   "source": [
    "# Nepo Baby Database Setup and Querying Notebook\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook provides a step-by-step guide to setting up the Nepo Baby PostgreSQL database, populating it with data, creating materialized views, and querying the database to retrieve information about influential individuals and their relatives.\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 1. Setup Files and Database Configuration\n",
    "\n",
    "### 1.1 Required Directories and Files\n",
    "Make sure the following directories exist:\n",
    "\n",
    "- `/database/nepobaby/init/`\n",
    "- `/database/nepobaby/data/`\n",
    "- `/database/nepobaby/query_result/`\n",
    "\n",
    "Make sure the following files are present in the `/database/nepobaby/init/` directory:\n",
    "\n",
    "- `init_nepobaby.sql`: SQL commands to initialize the database.\n",
    "- `load_data.sql`: SQL commands to load the data into the database.\n",
    "- `create_mv.sql`: SQL commands to create the materialized views.\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 2. Create Tables and Load Data\n",
    "\n",
    "### 2.1 Initialize the Database\n",
    "Run the `init_nepobaby.sql` file to create the necessary tables.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 2.2 Load Data\n",
    "Run the `load_data.sql` file to populate the tables with data.\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 3. Create Materialized View\n",
    "\n",
    "### 3.1 Create the Materialized View\n",
    "Run the `create_mv.sql` file to create the materialized view.\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 4. Query the Database\n",
    "\n",
    "### 4.1 Example Queries\n",
    "\n",
    "You can query the database to retrieve information about influential people and their relatives. Example:\n",
    "\n",
    "```sql\n",
    "SELECT * FROM top5influential;\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 5. Export Query Results\n",
    "\n",
    "You can export the result of a query to a CSV file using the `\\copy` command in PostgreSQL.\n",
    "\n",
    "Example:\n",
    "\n",
    "```sql\n",
    "\\copy (SELECT * FROM top5influential) TO '/database/nepobaby/query_result/top5influential.csv' WITH CSV HEADER;\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 6. Next Steps\n",
    "\n",
    "- Customize the SQL queries as needed.\n",
    "- Review the materialized views for optimization.\n",
    "- Explore relationships and influence metrics in the dataset.\n"
   ]
